# The same power > 0 guard on the blocker's own half of the exchange: Hill
# Giant (3/3) attacks; Ornithopter (0/2) blocks. The Giant's 3 damage kills
# the Thopter outright, but the Thopter's 0 power never calls
# dealPermanentDamage against the Giant at all -- it takes no damage marked,
# not merely an amount too small to matter.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
